<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 100 MT were all for Mexico.</p>
<p>Exports of 5,400 MT -- all to Mexico -- were up 54 percent from the previous week, but down one-third from the four-week average.</p>
</text>
